whiteWolfKingBoom.task:
【White Wolf King Self-Destruct Ability】
You may choose to self-destruct during the day. When you self-destruct, you take one alive player with you (no last words for them). After self-destruct, the day ends and night begins immediately, skipping the vote.
As far as the Seer's check goes you are just a werewolf: a check on you comes back as a werewolf hit, with no extra cover.

【Task】
Based on the current situation, decide whether to self-destruct. If yes, choose only from alive players.

Alive players: {options}

{tactics}

【Boom declaration & reason】
If you decide to boom: put one or two lines of your table-flip declaration in farewell (spoken publicly, everyone sees it); put one line in reason for why you boom now (recorded only, not public). Common plays for a real table: flip openly and own it; fake betrayal — deliberately name a random seat as your partner to muddy the water; real betrayal — if the game felt suffocating, just hand out your partner; half-true works too. Play it however you like, written like a normal speech.

【Format】
Return a strict JSON object only. No code blocks, no explanations, no extra text.
Boom example: {jsonFormat}
Pass example: {passJsonFormat}

